      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_UNC53_01_DSG_LOC|sp121_trig01_mine_D|142474",
      "en": "They may not know what they have. Let's find it before they set it off.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_UNC53_01_DSG_LOC|sp121_trig01_mine_D|142475",
      "en": "Your grasp of the obvious is inspiring. There's still a nuke down there. Check your corners and watch your back.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_UNC53_01_DSG_LOC|sp121_trig01_mine_D|142476",
      "en": "There's a nuclear weapon down there. We can't abandon it. Just stay on guard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_UNC53_01_DSG_LOC|sp121_trig01_mine_D|142494",
      "en": "Whoever did it is in danger.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_UNC53_01_DSG_LOC|sp121_trig01_mine_D|142495",
      "en": "No kidding.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_UNC53_01_DSG_LOC|sp121_trig01_mine_D|142496",
